depends append
connect imap main
# some imap clients don't wait around, but send us lots of commands and
# hope they all are valid. this script simulates such a client.
send 5
a list "" %
b login script script
c select inbox
d list "" INBOX
e fetch 1:* (uid flags)
receive 18
* OK [CAPABILITY IMAP4rev1 AUTH=ANONYMOUS AUTH=CRAM-MD5 AUTH=DIGEST-MD5 AUTH=PLAIN AUTH=LOGIN COMPRESS=DEFLATE ENABLE ID SASL-IR STARTTLS] imapscript.test.oryx.com Archiveopteryx IMAP Server (security checking disabled)
a BAD Not permitted before authentication
b OK [CAPABILITY IMAP4rev1 ACL APPENDLIMIT=38400000 BINARY CHILDREN COMPRESS=DEFLATE CONDSTORE CREATE-SPECIAL-USE ENABLE ESEARCH I18NLEVEL=1 ID IDLE LIST-EXTENDED LITERAL+ MOVE MULTIAPPEND NAMESPACE OBJECTID QUOTA QRESYNC RIGHTS=ekntx SORT SORT=DISPLAY SPECIAL-USE STARTTLS THREAD=ORDEREDSUBJECT THREAD=REFS THREAD=REFERENCES UIDONLY UIDPLUS UNSELECT UTF8=ACCEPT WITHIN] done
* 4 EXISTS
* 0 RECENT
* OK [UIDNEXT 5] next uid
* FLAGS (\Answered \Deleted \Draft \Flagged \Seen)
* OK [PERMANENTFLAGS (\Answered \Deleted \Draft \Flagged \Seen \*)] permanent flags
* OK [UIDVALIDITY 1] uid validity
* OK [MAILBOXID (f...)] stable mailbox ID
c OK [READ-WRITE] done
* LIST (\hasnochildren) "/" INBOX
d OK done
* 1 FETCH (UID 1 FLAGS ())
* 2 FETCH (UID 2 FLAGS (\Seen))
* 3 FETCH (UID 3 FLAGS ())
* 4 FETCH (UID 4 FLAGS ())
e OK done
end
